	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quod <persName ref="p8124">Naogeorgum</persName> attinet, novi illum non <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ex scriptis modo, sed de facie etiam, et quod am<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>plius est, de ingenio et moribus quoque.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Fam<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>iliariter enim cum eo versatus sum <placeName ref="l18">Augustae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>et postea <placeName ref="l245">Kauffbürae</placeName> quoque ipsum invisi.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Ipse quoque bis <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>vel ter apud nos hic fuit et nostris non ignotus <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>est; non nescimus etiam, quomodo <placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName> se gesserit <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>et quomodo illinc discesserit.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Miratus sum saepe, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quomod tamdiu cum <persName ref="p458">Brentio</persName> tranquille viveret <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>aut quomodo <persName ref="p458">Brentius</persName> ipsum in eadem secum ecclesia <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ferret.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Nunc erupit, quod futurum iam <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>pridem metuebam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Caeterum, ut apud nos <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>illi prospiciatur, non video esse probabile; ad concio<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>nandum enim propter barbaram vocis dialectum <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>non erit idoneus; cui vero professioni praefici possit, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ignoro, cum nulla vacet.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Et ut, quod verum est, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>fatear, horremus omnes illius ingenium; est enim <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>capitosus valde et caput habet admodum hetero<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>clitum, ut vocant, et talis nisi fuisset, iam <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>pridem apud nos habuisset locum.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Ego impe<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>traveram illi semel conditionem satis honestam; <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>sed quoniam minus videbantur illi splendida omnia, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>non sine indignatione aliqua a nobis discessit.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Video ego nec illum nostrae gentis mores nec <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>nostros illius ferre posse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Alioqui vir est valde <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>eruditus et mihi propter synceritatem doctrinae <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>inprimis apprime charus, et quem ego bene fer<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>re possem, si viderem alios idem posse.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Utinam <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>ipse in <placeName>Palatinatu</placeName> locum aliquem habere possit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/><placeName ref="l210">Heidelbergenses</placeName> <persName ref="p8417">Musculum</persName> a nobis abstrahere conantur; <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>vocant enim illum, ut <persName>Tilemanno</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>succedat, splendidamque ei offerunt conditionem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Sed ut nostri illum non dimittunt, apud quos <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>in magna est gratia, ita ipse quoque animum suum <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>ad quietem applicuit, ut non facile ullam aliam <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>conditionem sit suscepturus.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Itaque honeste vo<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>cationem illam recusat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Missus erat illius rei gratia <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>ad nos cum literis nostras hic <persName>Turingus Ruͦstius</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>qui has tibi defert, ut eius tentaret animum.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Puto <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>illum vestro quoque usurum consilio, quem existi<lb xml:id="p1z42"/>metis illic constitui posse idoneum.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Vobis ergo <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>illum commendo; est bonae spei adolescens, qui aliquam<lb xml:id="p1z44"/>diu nunc <placeName ref="l210">Heidelbergę</placeName> literis operam dedit et optimum a <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>d. <persName>Erasto</persName> habet testimonium.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Uitnam syncerus <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>aliquis theologus illic constitui posset!</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Plurimum <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>hoc <persName>Lutheranam</persName> impediret factionem et veritatis <lb xml:id="p1z48"/>causam promoveret; est enim ille locus in meditullio <lb xml:id="p1z49"/>quasi <placeName ref="l822">Germanię</placeName> situs et principis illius authoritas <lb xml:id="p1z50"/>apud reliquos quoque <placeName ref="l822">Germaniae</placeName> principes maxima est.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>De conspiratione in <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> idem apud nos quoque <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>volitant rumores qui apud vos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Audimus ad 6000 <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>esse coniuratorum; sed consilia ipsorum esse detecta <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>et primores quosdam ex ipsis comprehensos graviter <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>torqueri, ut eliciatur ex ipsis omnis rei veritas.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Ferunt <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>etiam <persName ref="p8621">Guisianum principem</persName> cum instructo milite <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>passim per <placeName ref="l832">Galliam</placeName> vagari, munitiora loca, vias <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>et transitus occupare et providere, ne coniurati, <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>qui dispersi sunt, convenire possint, sicque magnam <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>iam susceptorum consiliorum partem esse fractam.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z11"/>Quodsi verum est, plus quam antea unquam <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>sanguine christiano madebit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Dominus misereatur ecclesię <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>suę et liberet eam a tyrannide.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z14"/>Res <placeName ref="l2478">Sabau<lb xml:id="p2z15"/>dicae</placeName> nunc quiescunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Spes erat, ut cum <placeName ref="l167">Gene<lb xml:id="p2z16"/>vatibus</placeName> componerentur amice omnia; sed adhuc pendent <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>omnia infecta.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Dominus det hic quoque effectum foelicem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p2z18"/>Salutant te <persName ref="p8417">Musculus</persName>, <persName ref="p3494">Diesbachius</persName>, <persName ref="p8012">Hallerus</persName>, socer, mater <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>item mea.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutem dic tuis omnibus nostro nomine.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z20"/><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> 22. martii 1560.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z21"/><persName ref="p8018">Hall[erus]</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">Cl<lb xml:id="p2z22"/>arissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae pastori fidelissimo, domino et compatri suo observa<lb xml:id="p2z23"/>ndo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Beifügung von <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Hand am Schluss des Briefes:]</note>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="de">Inert acht oder 10 tagen <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>ist das kloster St. Moritzen in <placeName ref="l2651">Nid<lb xml:id="p2z25"/>erwallis</placeName> gelägen, inn grund <lb xml:id="p2z26"/>ußbrunnen biß an ettliche gehüse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="de">Das fhüwr ist dermassen starck xin, das ein castell, in einem <lb xml:id="p2z27"/>felsen ob dem klo<lb xml:id="p2z28"/>ster ein guͦts gelägen, och darvon angangen und ußbrunnen.</s>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="de">Hätt wenig gefällt, <lb xml:id="p2z29"/>das stettli darby hätte och lyd<lb xml:id="p2z30"/>en müssen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="37" xml:lang="de">Gen <lb xml:id="p2z31"/><placeName ref="l2451">Appenzell</placeName> sind geordnet j[unkher] <persName ref="p5787">Gladi Mey</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z32"/>sy zuͦ klagen und ein sthüwr zuͦ bringen; weiß nitt eigentlich, ob 200 gl. oder kr.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="38" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z33"/>In <placeName ref="l1827">Provincia</placeName>, nitt wyt von <placeName ref="l1827">Ayx</placeName> (ist nitt das Aix in <lb xml:id="p2z34"/><placeName ref="l736">Pemondt</placeName>, Aquae Sextiae) sollend der conjuratoren ettlich fändli geschlagen und erlegt sin, <lb xml:id="p2z35"/>7 hoptlüt gefangen und andere mee, welche einandren nach, <lb xml:id="p2z36"/>doch wyt von einandren an der landtstraaß an die böumm söllend <lb xml:id="p2z37"/>erhänckt sin.</s>
					<s n="39" xml:lang="de">Gott gäbe aber sach ein gnädigen ußtrag.</s>
					<s n="40" xml:lang="la">2. aprilis <lb xml:id="p2z38"/>1560.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
